; PORT-DEVIATION D47 (not part of the original): the «улучшения» / «enhancements» panel, the third sub-tab of Options > graphics.
; Port-own layout read by the same engine, embedded in the binary (nfs_game::display_opts), loaded as the panel
; ID_DISPLAYPANEL that display_graphics.lay (spliced into graphics.lay at load) names and display_tab.lay's tab button
; selects; it is a panel layout like graphicsettings.lay / advgraphics.lay (no screen of its own, the Options oval behind).
; Built from widget types the original's display.lay uses. The rows (a caption label + a level combo bound to
; PortDisplay.<token>) are NOT in this file: they are generated from the options table (nfs_game::display_opts::REGISTRY) and
; inserted right after section 0 at load (ahead of the backgrounds below: the first section takes the click,
; 0x528C00). Strings are the port's own table (ids 950000 and up), not FEStrings.loc.
[section.0]
id=REAL.BLACK_640x480
name=ID_SCREEN
size=640,480
color=0xff0000ff
screen=
room=
callbacklist=
musicfile=menu*
canplaygame=

